# Wave W17-Y (Gallant Cavern): keep wall — dressed shore stone: warm banded stone carrying the embankment’s masonry under the hill, even courses with sparse pale glints where the cavern’s crystals catch the dark (design: the cave keeps the north shore; its pool the colour of decisions). Gallant Cavern’s own wall — split from its twin Insight Cavern’s glint wall by temperature entire (warm shore stone vs frost) and from the Ruined Path’s rubble vault by keeping: these courses were laid, those fell.
